solution_md:
By Titu's Lemma, we have
\begin{align*}
\frac{(1^2)^2}{1}+\frac{(2^2a_1)^2}{2a_1^2}+\cdots+\frac{(9^2a_8)^2}{9a_8^2}\ge \frac{(1^2+2^2a_1+3^2a_2+\cdots+9^2a_8)^2}{1+2a_1^2+3a_2^2+\cdots+9a_8^2}
\end{align*}
and the left hand side is equal to  $1^3+2^3+\cdots+9^3=2025.$  Therefore, we have that 
\begin{align*}
\frac{(1^2+2^2a_1+3^2a_2+\cdots+9^2a_8)^2}{1+2a_1^2+3a_2^2+\cdots+9a_8^2}\le 2025,
\end{align*}
which is achieved when  $a_i=i+1.$
